# NexusSettle

Read `docs/BEGINNER_SETUP.md` before first-run work. Architecture: `docs/A2A_CLEARING.md`.
Commands: `npm run check:clearing-config`, `npm run test:clearing`, `npm run lint`, `npm run build`.

Do not:

- Commit `.env.local` or any wallet/API secret
- Enable mainnet (`CLEARING_MAINNET_ENABLED`) during A-stage work
